# MSBuild output. OutDir/IntDir are pinned to the project directory
# (DeskTick.vcxproj), so these sit under src\DeskTick\.
[Xx]64/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
[Ww]in32/
[Oo]bj/
.vs/
*.user

# Resource-editor backup, written beside DeskTick.rc if it is opened in VS.
*.aps

# MSIX packaging output. Only Package.appxmanifest and Images\ are source;
# the wapproj rebuilds the rest.
AppPackages/
BundleArtifacts/
*.assets.cache

# Store publisher identity and reserved app names, written by VS when the app
# is associated with a Store listing. Account metadata, not source — anyone
# building this associates with their own account, or doesn't package at all.
Package.StoreAssociation.xml

# Agent guidance, kept local to the working copy.
CLAUDE.md

# Test-signing certificate. Never a build input — the wapproj makes one on
# demand — and committing a private key to a public repo is not recoverable.
*.pfx
